NDI SDK headers (Processing.NDI.*.h), version 6, as DistroAV vendors them
(github.com/DistroAV/DistroAV, lib/ndi; fetched October 2026).

Each header carries this notice: the MIT licence below applies to these files
only, not to the NDI SDK as a whole (http://ndi.link/ndisdk_license). Montage
includes the headers alone, to load the NDI Runtime when it is installed; the
runtime itself is neither linked nor shipped (download: http://ndi.link/NDIRedistV6).

